{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284260","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1028426001:1":{"text":"... 누구시죠?!","source_cn":"……你们是谁？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x067D78997DF6F380","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028426002:1":{"text":"땅거미 순찰대의 라이카라고 합니다. 채집대 영지에서 나오신 식물학자인가요?","source_cn":"我是薄暮巡游队的莱卡，你们是从采集队营地出发的那两位植...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23A1026BDFEBA05F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028426003:1":{"text":"어?... 저 사람은 왜 바닥에 누워있죠?! 괜찮은 건가요?!","source_cn":"咦……为什么你的同伴躺在地上？！他没事吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50ED6947706EEFAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028426004:1":{"text":"순... 순찰대군요. 아, 그게 이 사람은... 놀라서 그래요! 맞아요, 놀라서 기절했어요!","source_cn":"巡……巡游队啊，哦，对，他是……吓坏了！对，吓晕了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x117CBD2035D8FCB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028426005:1":{"text":"밖에 몬스터가 쫓아와서 계속 도망가다가... 맞아요, 그래서... 기절했어요!","source_cn":"外面有魔物追击，我们一路逃……对，然后他……他就晕过去了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BBFA9B907E4B107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028426006:1":{"text":"어디 아파요? 왜 그렇게 말을 더듬어요?","source_cn":"你不舒服吗？为什么结结巴巴的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF90206FE20CB5372","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028426007:1":{"text":"제가... 콜록, 몸이 좀 안 좋아서... 콜록!","source_cn":"我……咳，我是有点不舒服……咳咳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x985866C74FADD6FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028426008:1":{"text":"동료분은 기절한 지 얼마나 됐나요? 저희가 도와드릴까요?","source_cn":"你的同伴晕过去多久了？需要我们帮忙吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF08250B31378A4E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028426009:1":{"text":"네? 아, 괜, 괜찮아요... 저기... 조금 있으면 깨어날 거예요...","source_cn":"啊？哦，不，没事……他……他应该过一会就能醒过来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33C39E02083395F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1028426009":{"text":"네? 아, 괜, 괜찮아요... 저기... 조금 있으면 깨어날 거예요...","source_cn":"啊？哦，不，没事……他……他应该过一会就能醒过来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33C39E02083395F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028426010:1":{"text":"저기 선생님, 두 분에게 무슨 일이 있었는지 좀 알고 싶은데요...","source_cn":"先生，我想再多了解一下你们之前遇到的状况……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B5A96256AAC8582","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1028426011:1":{"text":"라이카와 식물학자가 대화하는 사이 치피가 동굴 벽의 그림자를 이용해 책상 옆으로 슬그머니 이동했다.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6C76B245353397F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028426012:1":{"text":"이건... 마스터, 이것 좀 보세요!","source_cn":"这是……主人，我拿回来了，你们看！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x43790CD8109A0589","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이건... 마스터, 이것 좀 보세요!","female":"이건... 마스터, 이것 좀 보세요!","variant_male_record_index":"113311","variant_female_record_index":"113312","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028426013:1":{"text":"...야! 이 더러운 쥐새끼가! 내 물건 건드리지 마!","source_cn":"——喂！肮脏的耗子！别碰我的东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A4076C5428AADCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028426014:1":{"text":"이건... 채집대가 마을에 보낸 구조 요청 편지 아닌가요?","source_cn":"这是……采集队写给村子的求助信？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC2757D58F9C0EF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028426015:1":{"text":"당신들... 왜 편지를 함부로 뜯은 거죠?!","source_cn":"你们……你为什么私自把信拆开了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2FC5526D13B6AC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028426016:0":{"text":"당신 동료는 대체 왜 기절한 거죠? 사실대로 말하세요!","source_cn":"你的同伴到底是怎么昏倒的，请诚实地回答！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C805C1FD901565B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028426017:1":{"text":"흥... 대충 넘어갈 수 있었는데... 정말 귀찮은 녀석들이군!","source_cn":"哼……本来还想着能应付过去的，你们这些人真是麻烦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0BE7F1A1F94A03B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028426018:1":{"text":"꼭 그렇게 꼬치꼬치 캐물어야겠어? 이건 다 네놈들이...","source_cn":"非要问那么多问题，这只能怪你们自己——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7A01E6088AFFADA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1028426019:1":{"text":"자초한 일이야!","source_cn":"多此一举！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE1E0A886795C10C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1028426020:1":{"text":"큰일이에요, 몬스터가 몰려오고 있어요!","source_cn":"糟了，周围有魔物围过来了……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62F8F1ED3E44603C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1028426021:1":{"text":"마스터, 조심하세요!","source_cn":"主人，小心！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7F3D026858902BF4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 조심하세요!","female":"마스터, 조심하세요!","variant_male_record_index":"113321","variant_female_record_index":"113322","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"정말 조금도 의심스럽지 않네","source_cn":"真是一点也不可疑呢","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBA91896338E0A3FA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"정말 조금도 의심스럽지 않네","female":"정말 조금도 의심스럽지 않네","variant_male_record_index":"61872","variant_female_record_index":"61873","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"(치피에게 조사하라는 눈치를 준다)","source_cn":"（暗示满满去调查）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7BF11DE254D69480","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"(치피에게 조사하라는 눈치를 준다)","female":"(치피에게 조사하라는 눈치를 준다)","variant_male_record_index":"61874","variant_female_record_index":"61875","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:“植物学家”瓦西里":{"text":"‘식물학자’ 바실리에","source":"“植物学家”瓦西里","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":25,"localized_text_count":24,"speaker_count":4}}